{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_B96C36A9","title":"Saban in the sewers","entry":"Dlg_B96C36A9::entry","exit":"Dlg_B96C36A9::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_8126D7D6","articyId":"72057645577540636","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"Hey, we're just a couple of rats down in the sewers now, right? What brings you down here little rat friend?","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey, we're just a couple of rats down in the sewers now, right? What brings you down here little rat friend?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44128","byteOffset":31029032,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_8D0FBC54","articyId":"72057645577540657","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"Can you guess why I'm down here?","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Can you guess why I'm down here?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":600.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17726","byteOffset":14595376,"byteLength":376}},{"id":"DFr_D9B5404B","articyId":"72057645577540678","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"I'm trying to make a quick buck. The LUZ has stopped a lot of the more... esoteric items making it into Meridian. One of them is a fungus Ma Gomba sells. She thinks she harvested it all, but I know a spot where it blooms.","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm trying to make a quick buck. The LUZ has stopped a lot of the more... esoteric items making it into Meridian. One of them is a fungus Ma Gomba sells. She thinks she harvested it all, but I know a spot where it blooms.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49156","byteOffset":32937648,"byteLength":568}},{"id":"DFr_87D91F98","articyId":"72057645577540701","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"I'm good. I'm actually enjoying the solitude. But I wanted to pose you a question... if you have the time?","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm good. I'm actually enjoying the solitude. But I wanted to pose you a question... if you have the time?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19880","byteOffset":15404360,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_0F8DF7CE","articyId":"72057645577540706","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"Thanks. I'm enjoying the solitude. Though I have a question for you first, if you have the time?","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Thanks. I'm enjoying the solitude. Though I have a question for you first, if you have the time?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":-125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22318","byteOffset":16328824,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_4842E0C8","articyId":"72057645577540731","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"All good. See you later, stranger.","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"All good. See you later, stranger.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42871","byteOffset":30549504,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_47D0E482","articyId":"72057645577540740","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"If you knew something terrible would happen to everyone, but you couldn't change it, and you couldn't prove it, what would you do? How would you act?","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If you knew something terrible would happen to everyone, but you couldn't change it, and you couldn't prove it, what would you do? How would you act?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":-175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51293","byteOffset":33819232,"byteLength":472}},{"id":"DFr_C7D22101","articyId":"72057645577540753","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"If each moment is neither the future nor the past, but a slice between the two so thin it doesn't exist, does the past and future matter? If the past is a story that's already been told, and the future doesn't exist yet, is the moment all that matters?","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If each moment is neither the future nor the past, but a slice between the two so thin it doesn't exist, does the past and future matter? If the past is a story that's already been told, and the future doesn't exist yet, is the moment all that matters?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":-175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21811","byteOffset":16140800,"byteLength":644}},{"id":"DFr_D171E815","articyId":"72057645577540782","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"You don't get it at all. But that's OK. I'll see you around. I need to be alone for a while.","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You don't get it at all. But that's OK. I'll see you around. I need to be alone for a while.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":3600.0,"y":75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49659","byteOffset":33128336,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_64E6AE2B","articyId":"72057645577540787","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"But you know the outcome of the choices. And the terrible thing will still happen. Still...that's an interesting answer. I'll need to think about that.","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"But you know the outcome of the choices. And the terrible thing will still happen. Still...that's an interesting answer. I'll need to think about that.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3600.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21633","byteOffset":16074424,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_273D3712","articyId":"72057645577540792","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"Do you really believe that? That people can learn lessons and we don't make the same mistakes? Humanity can't stop making the same mistakes! Neither can I!","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Do you really believe that? That people can learn lessons and we don't make the same mistakes? Humanity can't stop making the same mistakes! Neither can I!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":3600.0,"y":-400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40469","byteOffset":29638064,"byteLength":472}},{"id":"DFr_D17259F8","articyId":"72057645577540815","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"Drinking to feel better. Thinking I can reason my way out of depression. Responding to emotional breakdowns with logical arguments.","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Drinking to feel better. Thinking I can reason my way out of depression. Responding to emotional breakdowns with logical arguments.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":4225.0,"y":-400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25800","byteOffset":17643272,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_D47690A2","articyId":"72057645577540831","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Saban Greggs","text":"I need some time. We can talk later. Hey, have a great day, OK?","speakerId":"Ntt_FF9CE953","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I need some time. We can talk later. Hey, have a great day, OK?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":4825.0,"y":-400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39205","byteOffset":29164096,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_18BF5B7B","articyId":"72057645577540642","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Work.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Work.","TextSheVersion":"Work.","TextTheyVersion":"Work."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":300.0,"y":-125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50578","byteOffset":33475848,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_C2EF54B9","articyId":"72057645577540649","type":"ch