"Player","text":"Memories are what matter. Lessons from the past help us avoid the disasters of the future.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Memories are what matter. Lessons from the past help us avoid the disasters of the future.","TextSheVersion":"Memories are what matter. Lessons from the past help us avoid the disasters of the future.","TextTheyVersion":"Memories are what matter. Lessons from the past help us avoid the disasters of the future."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3300.0,"y":-375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28682","byteOffset":18734128,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_19BB6D0E","articyId":"72057645577540766","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"The moment is all that matters. What you think and feel and the choices you make.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The moment is all that matters. What you think and feel and the choices you make.","TextSheVersion":"The moment is all that matters. What you think and feel and the choices you make.","TextTheyVersion":"The moment is all that matters. What you think and feel and the choices you make."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3300.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21908","byteOffset":16175856,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_5B3D798D","articyId":"72057645577540771","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"We need a bright future to look forward to. Hope is what matters.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We need a bright future to look forward to. Hope is what matters.","TextSheVersion":"We need a bright future to look forward to. Hope is what matters.","TextTheyVersion":"We need a bright future to look forward to. Hope is what matters."},"effects":[],"co